  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support delivery of CAFOD&apos;s country strategy priority of Conflict Resolution, a three-day Conflict Analysis workshop was organised in Colombo in November 2015 for CAFOD partners implementing projects seeking to address conflict resolution and peace building.  Nawaz Mohammed, Country Director - Sri Lanka and Maldives, Search for Common Ground/ End Violent Conflict was engaged as co-facilitator.</narrative>
